R(t)=\frac{t\cosh t}{\cosh^{2}t+t^{2}},\qquad t=kh,
\end{equation*}
so that with the free-air normalisation $e_{s}= \chi(t)S_{0}/\Delta\rho
g$,
\begin{equation*}
