\end{equation*}
i.e. $e_{s}\simeq kh\,S_{0}/\Delta\rho g$ on the long wave.  The
impermeable limit $\Phi(h)=0$ is $R(t)\to\chi_{{\rm imp}}(\eta)$,
$R(t)\simeq t\to \eta/4$ after the conventional $1/4$ normalisation,
which is the textbook $kh/4$ dynamic topography result quoted above.
∎

