In the harmonic ansatz

\begin{equation*}
\psi(x,z)=\Phi(z)\sin kx ,\qquad 
u_{x}=\Phi^{\prime}\sin kx,\;\;u_{z}=-k\Phi\cos kx ,
\end{equation*}
$(D^{2}-k^{2})^{2}\Phi=0$ and with $D=d/dz$

\begin{equation*}
p=-\frac{\mu}{k}\Big[\Phi'''-k^{2}\Phi'\Big]\cos kx ,
\qquad 
\sigma_{xz}=\mu\big[\Phi''+k^{2}\Phi\big]\sin kx ,
\qquad 
\sigma_{zz}= \frac{\mu}{k}\Big[\Phi'''-3k^{2}\Phi'\Big]\cos kx .
\end{equation*}
