\begin{equation*}
\chi_{{\rm imp}}(\eta)=\frac{\eta}{4}+O(\eta^{3}),\qquad
e_{s}\simeq\frac{kh}{4}\,\frac{S_{0}}{\Delta\rho g}>0 .
\end{equation*}
Absorbing the explicit $kh$ into the definition of the basal traction
this is the familiar $O(1)$ law

\begin{equation*}
