1.text:
With the stream function

\begin{equation*}
\psi(x,z)=\Phi(z)\sin kx,\qquad u_{x}=\Phi^{\prime}\sin kx,\;\;
u_{z}=-k\Phi\cos kx ,
\end{equation*}

\begin{equation*}
\Big(D^{2}-k^{2}\Big)^{2}\Phi=0,\qquad D=\frac{d}{dz},
\end{equation*}

\begin{equation*}
p=-\frac{\mu}{k}\Big[\Phi'''-k^{2}\Phi'\Big]\cos kx ,
\end{equation*}

\begin{equation*}
